<dialog id="inquiry-dialog" class="dialog inquiry-dialog"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="Close project inquiry">×</button><p class="eyebrow">LET’S BUILD SOMETHING THAT PERFORMS</p><h2>What are you working on?</h2><p class="dialog-intro">Build a project brief for our engineering team.</p><form id="inquiry-form"><div class="form-grid"><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required placeholder="Full name"></label><label>Work email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@company.com"></label><label>Company<input name="company" autocomplete="organization" required placeholder="Company name"></label><label>Application<select name="application"><option>Power & automation</option><option>Clean energy</option><option>Satellite & telecom</option><option>Aerospace & defense</option><option>EV & battery</option><option>Other application</option></select></label><label>Cooling approach<select name="cooling"><option>Help me choose</option><option>Air cooled heat sink</option><option>Liquid cold plate</option><option>Embedded heat pipes</option><option>Friction stir welding</option></select></label><label>Project stage<select name="stage"><option>Concept & feasibility</option><option>Design optimization</option><option>Prototype</option><option>Production</option></select></label></div><label>Tell us about your challenge<textarea name="details" required rows="3" placeholder="Heat load, temperature target, dimensions, quantity, timing…"></textarea></label><p class="small-note">The next step opens an email draft for you to review and send. Nothing is submitted automatically.</p><button class="btn btn-dark" type="submit">Prepare project inquiry <span>↗</span></button></form><div id="inquiry-review" hidden><h3>Your project brief is ready.</h3><p>Review your brief below, then open it in your email app or copy it into a message to Engineering@itscooling.com.</p><pre id="inquiry-preview"></pre><div class="button-row"><a class="btn btn-dark" id="inquiry-mail">Open email draft ↗</a><button class="outline-btn" id="copy-inquiry">Copy brief</button><button class="line-link" id="edit-inquiry">Edit</button></div><span class="small-note" id="copy-status" role="status"></span></div></dialog>
<dialog id="finder-dialog" class="dialog finder-dialog"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="Close solution finder">×</button><p class="eyebrow">A GOOD PLACE TO START</p><h2>Find your cooling approach.</h2><p>Answer two questions to explore a starting point for a conversation with ITS.</p><form id="finder-form"><fieldset><legend>Is a liquid cooling loop available in your system?</legend><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="loop" value="yes" required>Yes, a coolant loop is available</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="loop" value="no">No, we use ambient or forced air</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="loop" value="unsure">We’re still exploring the options</label></fieldset><fieldset><legend>What is your main design challenge?</legend><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="challenge" value="hotspots" required>Concentrated hot spots</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="challenge" value="density">High heat load in a compact space</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="challenge" value="simple">A practical, cost-conscious cooling solution</label></fieldset><button class="btn btn-dark" type="submit">Explore a starting point ↗</button></form><div id="finder-result" hidden aria-live="polite"></div></dialog>
<div class="toast" id="toast" role="status" hidden></div>
</body></html>
